{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05328","headline":"奉和幸上官昭容院献诗四首 一 · 郑愔","name":"奉和幸上官昭容院献诗四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地轴楼居远，天台阙路赊。\n何如游帝宅，即此对仙家。\n座拂金壶电，池摇玉酒霞。\n无云秦汉隔，别访武陵花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}